      "text": "A REAL AGREEMENT · DIGITAL WORK #1 Pay for the outcome. A worker deployed a public API. Accrue pinned the evidence, two independent verifiers approved the result, and the contract released payment on Monad testnet. WORKER PAYOUT · CONFIRMED ON-CHAIN 5.00 AUSD Verified and withdrawn",
