      "text": "01 / DEFINE Lock the policy The payer reserved 5 AUSD plus a 0.30 AUSD verifier pool after the worker accepted the terms. Expected endpoint GET /health → 200 Expected response status: ready Policy digest 0x5952…545f1f 02 / SUBMIT Pin the evidence The worker submitted a public GitHub commit and a live Cloudflare Worker deployment. Their manifest hash was recorded in the contract. Source GitHub commit ↗ Deployment Live /health ↗ 03 / VERIFY Check the result The public endpoint returned HTTP 200 and {\"status\":\"ready\"}. Two named reviewers signed pass votes for the pinned evidence version. Require",
