      "text": "Jev · job #1 No vote on this agreement · Cloudflare quota PENDING Reviewer B Signed pass vote · 0x5171…fC651 PASS Reviewer C Signed pass vote · 0x2aB9…6e105D PASS Inspect the deciding vote and settlement ↗ SETTLEMENT CONFIRMED 5.00 AUSD → worker The second pass vote changed the agreement to Paid. The worker then withdrew the earned reward from the contract. Reviewer B earned 0.10 AUSD Reviewer C earned 0.10 AUSD Unused fee returned to payer 0.10 AUSD Inspect the worker withdrawal ↗",
